# Packages
#-- LLC30 lightweight verification config (Task 4). useEXCH2 is
#   deliberately NOT listed: this namelist variable does not exist
#   anywhere in MITgcm source (confirmed by grepping model/, pkg/,
#   eesupp/ -- zero hits); pkg/exch2 is enabled purely at compile time
#   via code/packages.conf. useCAL is set explicitly (not left to the
#   useEXF-implies-useCAL default, which was removed at checkpoint66d).
 &PACKAGES
 useEXF   =.TRUE.,
 useCAL   =.TRUE.,
 useGGL90 =.TRUE.,
 &
